1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:02,339
Minecraft, but you can find,

2
00:00:02,339 --> 00:00:04,870
tame and raise your own little pets.

3
00:00:05,139 --> 00:00:06,910
Let me show you this cute mod.

4
00:00:08,184 --> 00:00:09,764
Ten rare pets hide

5
00:00:09,764 --> 00:00:11,534
in Minecraft's structures.

6
00:00:11,964 --> 00:00:14,334
The Desert Dragon lives in pyramids,

7
00:00:14,544 --> 00:00:16,794
the Jungle Dragon in jungle temples,

8
00:00:17,004 --> 00:00:19,534
and the Tide Dragon at ocean monuments.

9
00:00:19,904 --> 00:00:21,984
A penguin hides in igloos,

10
00:00:21,984 --> 00:00:23,444
and a living treasure chest waits

11
00:00:23,444 --> 00:00:25,074
in trial chambers.

12
00:00:26,329 --> 00:00:28,089
Not every structure has one,

13
00:00:28,089 --> 00:00:30,198
so every find is special.

14
00:00:30,649 --> 00:00:32,088
Craft a Tamagotchi Heart,

15
00:00:32,088 --> 00:00:33,228
give it to the pet,

16
00:00:33,228 --> 00:00:34,579
and it trusts you forever.

17
00:00:35,935 --> 00:00:37,535
From now on it needs you.

18
00:00:37,535 --> 00:00:39,015
Hunger, fun,

19
00:00:39,015 --> 00:00:41,275
energy and hygiene make up its mood,

20
00:00:41,275 --> 00:00:43,135
and the Tama Pager beeps

21
00:00:43,135 --> 00:00:45,065
whenever your pet needs something.

22
00:00:45,812 --> 00:00:47,512
Luckily, your pets take care

23
00:00:47,512 --> 00:00:48,472
of themselves when you

24
00:00:48,472 --> 00:00:49,922
build them a little home.

25
00:00:50,272 --> 00:00:51,912
They eat from the food bowl,

26
00:00:51,912 --> 00:00:53,682
splash around in the bath,

27
00:00:54,012 --> 00:00:56,012
bounce on the mushroom, run in the wheel,

28
00:00:56,012 --> 00:00:57,642
and sleep in their beds.

29
00:00:58,874 --> 00:01:00,334
You can play with them too.

30
00:01:00,334 --> 00:01:02,334
Pets chase the laser pointer,

31
00:01:02,334 --> 00:01:03,574
and when you pet them,

32
00:01:03,574 --> 00:01:05,584
they show you their heart eyes.

33
00:01:06,793 --> 00:01:07,973
Give your pet a chest

34
00:01:07,973 --> 00:01:09,253
and it carries a backpack

35
00:01:09,253 --> 00:01:11,163
with twenty-seven slots.

36
00:01:11,333 --> 00:01:12,713
Put golden apples inside,

37
00:01:12,713 --> 00:01:15,173
and when your health gets low,

38
00:01:15,173 --> 00:01:16,763
your pet brings you one.

39
00:01:17,929 --> 00:01:20,299
Every pet has its own talent.

40
00:01:20,749 --> 00:01:22,919
The Desert Dragon roasts your food,

41
00:01:23,109 --> 00:01:25,509
the Pebble Golem sniffs out ores,

42
00:01:25,509 --> 00:01:26,749
the Frost Penguin freezes

43
00:01:26,749 --> 00:01:28,669
water under your feet,

44
00:01:28,669 --> 00:01:30,919
and the Ember Pup swims through lava.

45
00:01:32,205 --> 00:01:35,085
The dragons can even fly after you.

46
00:01:35,085 --> 00:01:37,125
In a fight, your pet has your back,

47
00:01:37,125 --> 00:01:38,615
and it never dies.

48
00:01:38,905 --> 00:01:40,465
It just curls up into an egg,

49
00:01:40,465 --> 00:01:42,135
and you can wake it up again.

50
00:01:42,945 --> 00:01:46,145
They dance to music, warm up at campfires,

51
00:01:46,145 --> 00:01:47,875
and hide from thunderstorms.

52
00:01:49,072 --> 00:01:51,372
And if you ever forget something,

53
00:01:51,372 --> 00:01:52,732
just craft the Tamacon,

54
00:01:52,732 --> 00:01:54,642
your little guide to everything.

55
00:01:56,041 --> 00:01:57,741
Tamagotchi is free on CurseForge.

56
00:01:57,741 --> 00:01:59,771
Link in the description!

